   "basis": "THE PUBLISHED BASE COVERS BATTERY'S MINORITY VENTURE ACTIVITY, NOT THE WHOLE FIRM. 115 control positions -- the firm's Buyout-labelled platforms and their constituents, the Freescale and Sabre consortium LBOs, the Internet Brands and EASY SOFTWARE take-privates, and two majority recapitalisations the site labels Growth (WebPT, Brightree) -- are excluded under COLLECTION.md 1's T3 control addendum and preserved in excluded.csv. The AUM and fund list above cover the WHOLE adviser, buyout included, because one fund family does both and no venture-only RAUM exists to report. Without this sentence the base would read as the firm's entire track record, which it is not."
